Research ai prompt library
title end

paragraph start
The first prompt drafts one evidence page.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
Read the notation usage guide and the research page template first.
Take the question I give you.
Search for reviews first, then single studies.
Write one research page, one question only.
Every claim needs its source in References. Mark secondary sources.
Paraphrase everything and keep any quote under fifteen words.
If you find no evidence, say so in the page and add a todo.
Stop after the page is written and checked.
code end

